        "title": "Allow owners and authors to delete messages",
        "body": "## Summary\n- allow authors to delete their own messages\n- allow workspace owners to delete channel and thread messages for moderation\n- preserve the DM boundary: non-author DM messages stay author-only even for workspace owners\n- keep moderators and other members blocked from deleting messages they did not author\n- add channel and thread delete controls that only render for eligible users, including no owner delete affordance in DMs\n- render deleted messages as placeholders and remove the stale blue self-message bubble / empty thread hint UI\n- rebuild embedded web assets from current `origin/main`\n\n## Validation\n- `pnpm build`\n- `pnpm --filter @clickclack/web typecheck`\n- `go test ./apps/api/internal/store/sqlite ./apps/api/internal/httpapi ./apps/api/internal/store/postgres`\n- `go test ./apps/api/internal/store/sqlite ./apps/api/internal/httpapi ./apps/api/internal/store/postgres -run 'TestMutationsCreateDurableEvents|TestMutationErrors|TestOwnersAndAuthorsCanDeleteMessages|TestDeleteMessagePreservesDirectMessageBoundary'`\n- `git diff --check`\n- Browser proof generated from a clean local run and committed to the separate proof repo: https://github.com/Solvely-Colin/pr-proof-assets/tree/main/clickclack/pr-72-admin-message-delete-dm-boundary\n\n## Redacted Browser Proof\nAuthor self-delete succeeds:\n\n![Author self-delete](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Solvely-Colin/pr-proof-assets/main/clickclack/pr-72-admin-message-delete-dm-boundary/01-author-self-delete.png)\n\nOwner channel moderation succeeds:\n\n![Owner channel delete](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Solvely-Colin/pr-proof-assets/main/clickclack/pr-72-admin-message-delete-dm-boundary/02-owner-channel-delete.png)\n\nModerator cannot delete another member channel message:\n\n![Moderator blocked](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Solvely-Colin/pr-proof-assets/main/clickclack/pr-72-admin-message-delete-dm-boundary/03-moderator-blocked.png)\n\nMember cannot delete another member channel message:\n\n![Member blocked](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Solvely-Colin/pr-proof-assets/main/clickclack/pr-72-admin-message-delete-dm-boundary/04-member-blocked.png)\n\nOwner cannot delete a DM message they did not author:\n\n![Owner DM denied](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Solvely-Colin/pr-proof-assets/main/clickclack/pr-72-admin-message-delete-dm-boundary/05-owner-dm-denied.png)",
